sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant SH as run.sh
    participant CLI as bench (CLI)
    participant RUN as Bench Runner
    participant GU as Grid Utils
    participant ALG as Planner (BFS/A*)
    participant MET as Metrics/Logger

    U->>SH: ./scripts/run.sh --algo astar --grid 32 --fill 0.25 --seed 42 --moves 4 --no-show
    SH->>CLI: ros2 run rbe550_grid_bench bench [...]

    CLI->>RUN: main(args) → run_bench(args)

    alt ASCII map provided
        RUN->>GU: load_grid_from_ascii(path)
    else random grid
        RUN->>GU: make_random_grid(size, fill, seed)
        GU-->>RUN: grid, free start/goal (or user-specified)
    end

    RUN->>GU: neighbors_fn = neighbors4|neighbors8
    RUN->>ALG: plan(grid, start_rc, goal_rc, neighbors_fn)

    note right of ALG: BFS = queue (unweighted)<br/>A* = PQ + heuristic

    ALG-->>RUN: path_rc, stats{nodes_expanded, ...}

    RUN->>MET: add runtime_ms, path_len
    MET-->>RUN: normalized stats

    RUN-->>CLI: print summary (success, path_len, runtime, nodes)
    CLI-->>U: console output / artifacts (optional)
